  "id": "negativistic-personality-disorder",
  "term": "negativistic personality disorder",
  "definition": "Negativistic personality disorder is a personality disorder marked by indirect resistance to social or work demands and by hidden expressions of anger or opposition to authority and others’ expectations. This may show up as obstruction, procrastination, stubbornness, dawdling, forgetfulness, or deliberate inefficiency.",
